        "description": "<p>Used for WP Fable Themes.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>From your WordPress dashboard</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Visit &#8216;Plugins &gt; Add New&#8217;,</li>\n<li>Search for &#8216;Fable Extra&#8217; and install the plugin,</li>\n<li>Activate &#8216;Fable Extra&#8217; from your Plugins page.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>From WordPress.org</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download &#8216;Fable Extra&#8217;.</li>\n<li>Upload the &#8216;fable-extra&#8217; directory to your &#8216;/wp-content/plugins/&#8217; directory, using your favorite method (ftp, sftp, scp, etc&#8230;)</li>\n<li>Activate &#8216;Fable Extra&#8217; from your Plugins page.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add ShopWay Theme Functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add eKart Theme Functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add EasyBuy Theme Functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed Issues</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add EazyShop Theme Functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add MiniCart Theme Functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed Issues</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Shopire Theme Functionality</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed Issue</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed Merlin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release!</li>\n</ul>\n"
